{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "latam", "appid": 548430, "month": "2020-03", "window": 1, "start_date": 1583020800, "end_date": 1585699199, "month_true_total": 13, "quota": 13, "returned": 13, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:31:13 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "65572310", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039441931", "personaname": "DAGUER", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198039441931/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 47611, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1393, "last_played": 1755205425, "avatar": "4ab3db0761bdfb0b02c32de00e0924e1270cf81a"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Adéntrate a un espacio cupular y espacioso de alguna cueva, apaga tu flashlight, escucha la música ambiental de fondo, mira la iluminación ambiental de los minerales y objetos bioluminicentes... Disfrutalo.", "timestamp_created": 1584902244, "timestamp_updated": 1584902244, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "64874068", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040630008", "personaname": "Jack Flame", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040630008/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 5220, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 389, "last_played": 1737666298, "avatar": "56f38b91a890f8456172fe7cb99d8f8dc72892a9"}, "language": "latam", "review": "No pienses mas, compra este juego. Es una obra maestra. Divertidisimo tanto en solitario como en co-op. Aunque es en la ultima modalidad donde brilla y se disfruta al %100. \nExcelente juego co-op. una mezcla entre Left 4 dead y Minecraft.", "timestamp_created": 1583948423